Teacher Civan and another one, I said I didn't understand
this...

774
00:49:46,000 --> 00:49:49,000
Hemî meş hate ser te min dît min xiste bîra xwe û ji xwe ra
pirsî digot..
 
All the bees came on you, I saw, I remembered and asked
myself, he was saying..

775
00:49:49,000 --> 00:49:52,000
Xebata wisa zemet e bi min re serê we diêşîne, ma nexweş
nakî te tiştek nabî?
 
Such work is hard with me, gives you a headache, doesn't it
make you sick, doesn't anything happen to you?

776
00:49:52,000 --> 00:49:54,000
Ew zemet e, destpêkê mirov weha ditirse..
 
It is hard, at first one is afraid like that..

777
00:49:54,000 --> 00:49:55,000
Tu çawa teyax dikî?
 
How do you endure?

778
00:49:55,000 --> 00:49:57,000
Ev normal e gava tu fêr bibe, edî weha namîne.
 
This is normal when you get used to it, it doesn't stay like
that anymore.

779
00:49:57,000 --> 00:50:00,000
Te fêrî wê kir hûn dibin dost wekî ev yek..
 
You got used to it, you become friends like this one..

780
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:02,000
...ji we û ji bernameya we da... razî ne.
 
...we are pleased with you and your program.

781
00:50:02,000 --> 00:50:03,000
Him.
 
Hmm.

782
00:50:03,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Lê min qet xeyal nedikir, mesele lê min, min hez dikir.
 
But I never imagined it, for example, I liked it.

783
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:09,000
Ku ev were bikişîne wisa, yanî ji me re kêf e.
 
